## Animation Stack
1. CSS + data attributes: `tw-animate-css` with `data-[state=*]` (`animate-in`, `fade-in-0`, `zoom-in-95`, `slide-in-from-*`)
2. Shadcn built-in Dialog/Popover/Sheet/Dropdown animations
3. Custom `data-*` + Tailwind `data-[state=x]:*`
4. Motion only for drag, scroll-linked, layout, gestures, shared-element. See @.cursor/skills/motion-v1
If `transition-*` or `animate-*` works, do not use Motion.

## Spacing (8pt)
xs `gap-1 p-1` · sm `gap-2 p-2 space-y-2` · md `gap-3 gap-4 p-4 space-y-4` · lg `gap-6 p-6` · xl `gap-8 p-8` · 2xl `p-10`
Layout: `p-4 md:p-6`. Forms: `space-y-2` / `space-y-4` / `space-y-6`. Avoid p-3, p-5, px-5 except micro-adjustments.

## Typography
xs captions · sm secondary/labels · base body · lg card titles · xl page titles · 2xl hero
Page titles: `text-lg md:text-xl font-heading font-semibold`. Card: `text-lg font-heading font-semibold`. Secondary: `text-sm text-muted-foreground`.

## Design
- Distinctive fonts; dashboard exception Inter + Poppins. `font-sans` UI, `font-heading` titles, `tabular-nums` prices, `font-mono` code. See @.cursor/skills/frontend-design-v1
- Semantic tokens (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`). See @.cursor/skills/tailwind-design-system-v4
- Motion: feedback, orientation, focus—never decorate. 100–150ms micro, 200–300ms transitions, 500ms drawers. `ease-out` default. Animate `transform`/`opacity` only. Never `scale(0)`—min 0.95. See @.cursor/skills/emilkowal-animations-v1
- Loading: skeleton that preserves layout; toasts for async success/failure; hover/focus states before extra animation
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`. Opacity fallback. Motion: `MotionConfig reducedMotion="user"`
